Narration Small Tweaks:
    ☐ Add additional narrations for combat - stop the repeat of "blood runs..."
      ☐ Player kills monster:
        ☐ Your foe falls before you and you breathe a sigh of relief.. for now.
        ☐ Your enemy lies before you in a crumpled heap, it's lifes essence seeping out slowly.
        ☐ The creature looks pathetic and harmless in it's state of frozen pain and death.
        ☐ Exasperated and grateful you step over your opponent and carry on.
        ☐ The place wreaks of blood and bits and sweat and pain and you smile in victory.
        ☐ With a deep sigh and a gathering of courage you press on.
        ☐ You wipe yourself clean of the fluids your enemy shared with you in their dance of death.
        ☐ Twitching and breathing a final breath your foe perishes from this realm.
        ☐ Another one meets the clearing at the end of the path. You strengthen your resolve for more.
        ☐ Death. Dealt. The cards to come unknown but the dealer you are just the same.
      ☐ Player kills monster with critical:
        ☐ The place is a horror, blood is everywhere, the walls are still echoing with the pain of your opponents demise.
        ☐ A ghastly sight of entrails and liquids coats all surfaces. What happened? What nightmare here occurred?
        ☐ The glint of light is fuzzy and hazy and red haloed shimmering with battle sick - you blink them away.
        ☐ Still attacking and shaking your rage finally subsides and you awake to a vision of disgust and anatomical ruin.
        ☐ With the final move you finish the dance in a crescendo of precision and deliberateness - everywhere blood.
        ☐ Blood. On your hands, your arms, your face, in your mouth. The salt of life. It tastes like success.
        ☐ The echoes of pain and fear reverberate off the surfaces of this place as you blink slowly back to normalcy.
        ☐ Sparks of rage and primordial electric currents of survival dance across your vision and course through your shaking body. VICTORY! YOURS!
        ☐ Shivering and careful you survey your surroundings; a grim visage of death and destruction.
        ☐ RAAAARRRRGGhgh! Charged electric with battle sickness and rage you cry victoriously into the unknown darkness.
      ☐ When character levels up - add 10 flavor texts:
        ☐ You have learned much and conquered more! You are emboldened and filled with vigor
        ☐ Everything that has stood between you and your goal has been ... handled. Well done.
        ☐ You feel as if nothing can stop you and you are determined to push ahead even if it means your end.
        ☐ Though the path has been perilous you have overcome and for that you are grateful and your soul galvanized for more.
        ☐ Before you lies god only knows, but you are not afraid; in fact you are thrilled and excited to meet the next challenge.
        ☐ Pain and suffering is no match for endurance and resolve. You will ascend and you will win.
        ☐ Lesser mortals would turn back now knowing greater challenges await, but not you, you welcome them.
        ☐ What is life without achievement? What is existence without testing the limits of such? Press on hero!
        ☐ This place has never before seen the likes of one such as you, clearly. You sense waiting dread, but it is not your own.
        ☐ You brook no quarter and suffer no fools. Onward you shall go, and into the hands of fate.
      ☐ Player hits monster:
        ☐ The creature blinks in dismay and disbelief as you chip away at it's mortality, you almost feel sorry for it. almost.
        ☐ With precision timing and strategy you bring death and harbor no mercy.
        ☐ A salty vision of blood and entrails coat the floor; wet death, theirs.
        ☐ Instinct takes over and you feel as if your movements are controlled by gods grace.
        ☐ The thrill of battle and survival soak you cold and slow time. It's as if your enemy is underwater and you are not.
        ☐ One strike at a time chips away at your foes composure and flow of life.
        ☐ Another brilliant maneuver and the creature becomes more and more pitiful; regret and fear in it's eyes.
        ☐ More. MORE! COME ON!!! you shout spit into the face of your foe gritting your teeth as your attack lands.
        ☐ Frenzy, absolute and all encompassing has made you into a killing machine.
        ☐ Rage and blood and fever embrace your cold movements as the dealer of death.
        ☐ Is there no end to your prowress and ability? Stunned and stricken your enemy cries in pain.
      ☐ Player crits monster:
        ☐ PRECISION! ARTISTRY! your attack sends the creature reeling, screaming!
        ☐ FEEL THE PAIN! DIE! you scream baring your teeth in a grimace of hatred.
        ☐ GET OFF ME! BASTARD! your attack finds home tilting the balance of battle.
        ☐ You are soaked with the blood of your enemy as it juts and sprays and coats the place.
        ☐ Cold calmness and deliberation come upon you. This is a dance, not a fight. 
        ☐ The battle sickness overtakes you, you are no longer here, you are watching yourself, and you are perfect.
        ☐ A vision of heat, fur, scales, and steel blurry and primal.
        ☐ TAKE THAT! you shout as you unleash your potential into the fray.
        ☐ DO YOU WANT SOME MORE?! you shriek as you flawlessly execute as your master had trained you.
        ☐ You were born for this. You live for this. You are unstoppable!
      ☐ Monster hits player:
        ☐ You blink glancing at the onslaught impact just in time to feel the sharp jagged rawness of it.
        ☐ This beast seems seasoned and as it tears into you growls a tribal cry of fury.
        ☐ Red, all red, and darkness. It hurts, the pain is distant but patiently waiting for you.
        ☐ Your body aches and tenses with the impact of the attack.
        ☐ Rushing and unstoppable the merciless fangs and teeth and limbs come at you.
        ☐ A fair blow from your foe, you cannot deny it.
        ☐ You catalog the pain and unthrottle your rage for payback.
        ☐ Blinking in disbelief as you thought you had out maneuvered that attack.
        ☐ Your rage grows commensurate with your pain and your anger throbs ready to pounce and repay the debt of wounds.
        ☐ God! That hurts!
      ☐ Monster crits player:
        ☐ How can this be?! It won't happen again.
        ☐ A fair and painful lesson at the hand of your enemy. You shall learn and not make that same mistake.
        ☐ A mess of fangs, scales, claws, and bones and you can only bite your own teeth as you feel the immediate brutal pain.
        ☐ MY! GOD!! THAT REALLY HURTS! 
        ☐ SON OF A.. ! YOU DIRTY! 
        ☐ Though you try to dodge the enemy is faster, and you feel the speed and force in it's fullness.
        ☐ This creature is either lucky or powerful or both.
        ☐ With only your grit are you able to absorb the incredible force and the pain and promise to pay it back.
        ☐ It's as if you might actually have to try here.
        ☐ DO NOT GIVE UP! you silently scream in your mind as the rising levels of heat and soreness throb and pulse. 
