    ☐ Explain in character creator what each stat does in a side panel
      ☐ STR:
        ☐ extra damage in combat per successful strike
        ☐ chance to break through doors and chests
        ☐ ablility to use stronger armor and melee weapons
        ☐ physical based saving throws
      ☐ DEX:
        ☐ bonus to armor class and dodging
        ☐ use flourishes to do more damage
        ☐ ability to use more precise missile weapons
        ☐ movement based saving throws and checks
      ☐ CON:
        ☐ extra HP per level
        ☐ resistances to elemental effects (poison, acid, shock, etc.)
        ☐ ability to endure great damage
        ☐ elemental based saving throws and checks
      ☐ INT:
        ☐ number of spells that can be cast
        ☐ speed of ambient spell recall 
        ☐ use magic flourishes for greater spell effects
        ☐ mental based saving throws and checks
      ☐ WIS:
        ☐ distance of vision and detection
        ☐ bonus to finding hidden things
        ☐ resistance to spell effects
        ☐ universal awareness saving throws bonus
      ☐ CHA:
        ☐ luck points (re-rolls)
        ☐ barter modifier (how much things cost, and how much you sell for)
        ☐ fate skew - less CHA = worse fate, more CHA = better fate
        ☐ reaction saving throws

